WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:03.410
The marketing funnel moves buyers from awareness and knowledge,

00:00:03.460 --> 00:00:05.037
to liking and preference,

00:00:05.087 --> 00:00:07.186
to conviction and purchase.

00:00:07.900 --> 00:00:10.668
A shopper notices a new juice on the big screen.

00:00:10.718 --> 00:00:12.437
Next visit, she prefers it to the others.

00:00:12.487 --> 00:00:15.810
Then she grabs one and buys.

00:00:16.500 --> 00:00:17.865
Baxter's media rule:

00:00:17.915 --> 00:00:21.474
reach about sixty-five percent of the audience at least three times.

00:00:21.524 --> 00:00:23.954
One exposure isn't enough.

00:00:24.667 --> 00:00:28.214
UNICEF spent ninety-five percent at the bottom and starved the top.

00:00:28.264 --> 00:00:32.857
So set an objective for every stage, and keep the top full.
